# Copy to .env (git-ignored). Needed only for speaker diarization in
# `local-transcribe transcribe`; without it the step runs without speaker labels.
# The token is used to download the models. The audio never leaves the machine.
#
# Accept the terms of ALL THREE gated models below before the token will work.
# The first two are the ones the pipeline names; the third is pulled in as a
# transitive dependency under pyannote-audio 4.x, so it fails with a 403 that
# names a repo you never asked for:
#
#   https://huggingface.co/pyannote/speaker-diarization-3.1
#   https://huggingface.co/pyannote/segmentation-3.0
#   https://huggingface.co/pyannote/speaker-diarization-community-1
#
# Then create a Fine-grained token with Read-Only rights at
# https://huggingface.co/settings/tokens and paste the value after the "="
# below -- the value only, with nothing appended to the line. Access is granted
# to the account, not to the token, so accepting terms afterwards does not
# require issuing a new one.
HF_TOKEN=
